7693804112", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673638530_1053937700470778_6299887377405960249_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mvSq8jggnYIQ7kNvwFZZJi_&_nc_oc=Adr46k0yA7ECTm6boApAafo1OKGgKRuNoK5fzgqQeFlGxwEKQftZZeaC6dD71rNIaMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH6GJiO2p9pUMCTAhRBhx1eyRA4YruCzfv3UrM74Ycovg&oe=6A81A2BE"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1752542886097145", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_1752542889430478_1819614256692818125_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NaTY7nx8ofcQ7kNvwGnJJ01&_nc_oc=AdpotpSx6bamyxjaAFICIMzj0ZUgg8lWJK9-1nqv12KsitKDCFqegf038KOM5TXQoTQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG0XrWw45ahXFtW9Imvvjal2Gnj-Kr6DehHMyPpXxSI7A&oe=6A819D3B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1 (2).png", "id": "1734595944459719", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622276_1734595947793052_2639806269991627472_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oEtfbNPvw1YQ7kNvwGPtbe8&_nc_oc=AdoDUAKx1zSqxib_tSj0F6ecVwC8m6jstkrRiO_PQ8SPYRXNNkp3YDaHheNU4tdAkgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFrUghXQSlq1wvWXxZnY7dAyrPYEfMW2dZnhzTVC9wOUQ&oe=6A81B423"}, "display_name": "Fit with Pets : Run, Workout & Relax", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Cardio", "Running", "Puppy", "Exercise"], "long_description": "# Turn Your Daily Run into a Joyful Dog Walk! \u26a1     \nReady for a cardio workout that doesn't feel like a chore? Fit with Pets transforms your fitness routine into a fun and rewarding run with an energetic virtual pup. Swing your arms to jog, keep pace, and make sure your furry friend stays happy. It's the perfect blend of fitness, fun, and relaxation!    \n\n\ud83d\udd25**Key Features:**\n\ud83d\udc3e **Dynamic Leash Mechanics:** Swing your arms to move! If you slow down, the leash pulls taut and your pup gets grumpy. Swing faster t